# Copy to `.env.local`. That file is gitignored — this remote is public.

# --- The model ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Same provider precedence as MCS. Keep this server-only; never prefix it with
# NEXT_PUBLIC_. Without one of these the chat replies with a configuration
# error and the heartbeat stays silent by design rather than inventing a line.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# Alternative for a Claude Code OAuth-backed local runtime:
# CLAUDE_OAUTH_TOKEN=

# --- Agent control -----------------------------------------------------------
# The highest mode this workspace permits: `self` or `collab`. Re-read on every
# request and clamped server-side, so a client asking for more gets less.
# Unset means `collab`, which is also the default the selector offers.
# DOS_AGENT_MODE_CEILING=collab

# --- The proactive loop ------------------------------------------------------
# Shared secret for `POST /api/events` (the SRE agent's ingest seam) and
# `POST /api/heartbeat`. Unset leaves both open, which is right for a laptop and
# wrong anywhere else — the ingest response says `unsecured: true` when it is.
# SRE_INGEST_SECRET=

# How often the standing loop beats, in seconds. Defaults to 900 (15 minutes),
# matching MCS's cron. Drop it to ~30 when demoing. `TRUNK_HEARTBEAT_LOCAL=0`
# turns the in-process loop off entirely, for when a real scheduler drives
# `POST /api/heartbeat` instead.
# TRUNK_HEARTBEAT_LOCAL_SECONDS=900
# TRUNK_HEARTBEAT_LOCAL=1

# --- Debugging ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Exposes `GET /api/agent/debug`: the last 20 model calls with lane, model,
# tools offered, requested-vs-clamped mode and errors. 404s when unset.
# DOS_AGENT_DEBUG=1
